+///               ###
+///               * 0x14
+///               * SDRAM Timing Register I
+///               ###
+///               %unsigned 8  init_tras                 0xF
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * tRAS (Active-to-Precharge Delay)-1
+///                                    * For example, init_tras = 7 means Active command to Precharge command has minimal 8 cycles delay
+///                                    ###
