+///                                    ###
+///               %unsigned 8  init_tfaw                 0x10
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * tFAW-1
+///                                    ###
+///               %unsigned 8  init_trfcmax              0x6C
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * tRFCMAX-1
+///                                    ###
+///     @ 0x00020 Timing4              (P)
+///               ###
+///               * 0x20
