+///                                    ###
+///               %%        8          # Stuffing bits...
+///     @ 0x00024 Control1             (P)
+///               ###
+///               * 0x24
+///               * SDRAM Control Register I
+///               ###
+///               %unsigned 8  init_taps                 0x3C
+///                                    ###
