+///                                    ###
+///               %unsigned 10 TSEN_DATA_MIN             0x0
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * Minimum value used to check against TSEN_DATA
+///                                    ###
+///               %unsigned 1  TSEN_OVERHEAT_SEL         0x0
+///                                    ###
