+///                                    ###
+///               %unsigned 16 hboAdr                    
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * HBO byte address for data transfer
+///                                    * [32:63]
+///                                    ###
+///     @ 0x00004                      (P)
+///               %unsigned 32 memAdr                    
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * Memory address equivalent to DDR addr [31:0];
+///                                    ###
+///     # # ----------------------------------------------------------
+/// $ENDOFINTERFACE  # size:       8B, bits:      64b, padding:     0B
