+///                                    * Up-to 16 channels
+///                                    ###
+///     @ 0x00CC0 BUSY                 (R-)
+///               %unsigned 16 ST                        
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * Per channel status
+///                                    * 0: no ongoing command is being processed, and no flushing is taking place
+///                                    * 1: channel controller is busy
+///                                    ###
+///               %%        16         # Stuffing bits...
+///     @ 0x00CC4 PENDING              (R-)
+///               %unsigned 16 ST                        
