+///     # # ----------------------------------------------------------
+///     @ 0x00000 WriteID              (R-)
+///               %unsigned 32 berrID                    0x0
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * ID of AXI Write Transaction that caused an error response
+///                                    ###
+///     @ 0x00004 WriteStat            (R-)
+///               %unsigned 1  berrType                  0x0
