+///                                    * 0101 = 15 μA (2.75 ~ 3.25 GHz).
+///                                    * 0111 = 20 μA (3.25 ~ 4 GHz).
+///                                    * VCO running frequency below
+///                                    * 2 GHz not supported.
+///                                    ###
