+///               %unsigned 1  Clear                     0x0
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * Writing 1 to this bit will clear the status and interrupt.
+///                                    * This bit self clears
+///                                    ###
+///               %%        30         # Stuffing bits...
+///     @ 0x00004 STATUS               (R-)
+///               %unsigned 1  Intr                      0x0
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * 0: No match to the regions has occurred
