+///                                    : HMAC                     0x11
+///                                    : GHASH                    0x12
+///               %unsigned 2  Usage                     
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * 2’b00: TS stream
+///                                    * 2’b01: M2M stream
+///                                    * 2'b10: PVR stream
+///                                    * 2’b11: Any
