+///               %unsigned 8  ID                        
+///               %unsigned 8  delta                     
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * CPU decreases CCounter by delta (0 as pop 256)
+///                                    ###
+///               %%        16         # Stuffing bits...
+///     @ 0x00388 empty                (WOC-)
