+///               ###
+///               %unsigned 2  mode                      0x0
+///                                    : stop                      0x0
+///                                    : step                      0x1
+///                                    : slow_run                  0x2
+///                                    : fast_run                  0x3
+///                                                 ###
+///                                                 * Same enumerations
+///                                                 ###
+///               %%        30         # Stuffing bits...
+///     @ 0x0000C figoDbgTrigInMask    (P)
+///               ###
+///               * 4 mask bits for trigger-in signals from up to 4 other FIGOs hitting breakpoints.
+///               ###
+///               %unsigned 4  on                        0xF
+///                                    ###
