+///               %%        16         # Stuffing bits...
+///     @ 0x00088                      (W-)
+///     #         # Stuffing bytes...
+///               %% 64
+///     @ 0x00090 figoDbgJumpStack     (RW-)
+///               ###
+///               * BIU access to jump stack
+///               ###
+///     # 0x00090 stack                
+///               $FigoMem32           stack             MEM       [4]
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * Register mapping
+///                                    * MEM[0] = {branchPos[0],jumpDest[0]}
