+///               %unsigned 23 enable                    0x0
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * Enable FIFO almost empty interrupts from HBO of FIGO 1
+///                                    ###
+///               %%        9          # Stuffing bits...
+///     @ 0x0001C hbo1_aempty_status   (R-)
