+///                                    * 10101: SLOW CORNER
+///                                    * 01011: FAST CORNER
+///                                    * 33 Ohm driver (strong driver for high-speed ~200MHz)
+///                                    * 10111: TYP CORNER
+///                                    * 11111: SLOW CORNER
+///                                    * 10000: FAST CORNER
+///                                    ###
