+///                                    * Base or Start address of the region
+///                                    * Bits [1:0] unused.
+///                                    ###
+///     @ 0x0000C ProtMask0            (P)
+///               %unsigned 32 Mask                      0x0
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * Used in conjunction with Addr to define region size
+///                                    * Bits [1:0] unused
+///                                    ###
+///     @ 0x00010 ProtAddr1            (P)
+///               %unsigned 32 Addr                      0x0
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * Base or Start address of the region
