+///                                    * Register window for the trace buffer
+///                                    ###
+///               %%        31         # Stuffing bits...
+///     @ 0x000B0                      (W-)
+///     #         # Stuffing bytes...
+///               %% 128
+///     # # ----------------------------------------------------------
+/// $ENDOFINTERFACE  # size:     192B, bits:     128b, padding:     0B
