+///                                    ###
+///                                    * 1: Monitor is enabled
+///                                    * 0: Monitor is disabled
+///                                    ###
+///               %unsigned 1  interrupt                 0x0
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * 1: Interrupt and Stop mode
