+///     @ 0x00008 AWQOS                (W-)
+///               %unsigned 4  LO                        0x0
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * AWQOS value when low priority
+///                                    ###
+///               %unsigned 4  HI                        0xF
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * AWQOS value when high priority
+///                                    ###
+///               %%        24         # Stuffing bits...
