+///               %unsigned 4  LO                        0x0
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * ARQOS value when low priority
+///                                    ###
+///               %unsigned 4  HI                        0xF
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * ARQOS value when high priority
+///                                    ###
+///               %%        24         # Stuffing bits...
