+///                                    * 0: TS output works in 8-bit parallel mode.
+///                                    ###
+///               %unsigned 1  serial_pin_select         0x0
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * 1: In serial mode, use tsoData[7] as data pins
+///                                    * 0: In serial mode, use tsoData[0] as data pins
+///                                    ###
